  "description": "Source generators for a MagicCSharp codebase. The compiler writes use case interfaces ([GenerateInterface]), the opt-in Executing log line ([LogExecuting]), DAL mapping, repository filter queries and their in-memory Matches, HTTP clients ([MagicClient]), test fake bases ([GenerateFakeBase]), an assembly loader and design-time DbContext factories, on every build. Generated code is never committed; the IDE shows it. Also ships MagicCSharp.Generators.Declarations, the declaration model other generators build on.",
